msgid ""
"Applies to Huggingface and Faster Whisper models. Reduces GPU memory usage "
"but may slightly decrease transcription quality."
msgstr ""
"يتوفر لنماذج Hugging Face وFaster Whisper. يقلّل استهلاك ذاكرة معالج "
